[TITLE]
CRASH-06: a GPV whose head loss curve has a single point
Reservoir R1 supplies 1000 gpm to J1 through GPV V1.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     1000

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   100

[VALVES]
;ID  N1  N2  Diam  Type  Setting
 V1  R1  J1  12    GPV   C1

[CURVES]
;ID  Flow  HeadLoss
 C1  500   10         ; one point only: no segment to interpolate on

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[OPTIONS]
 Units     GPM
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
